<title>UK: John Mowlem appoints Brown finance chief.</title>
<headline>John Mowlem appoints Brown finance chief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK construction group John Mowlem and Co Plc said on Friday it had appointed Gerald Brown to the board as finance director.</p>
<p>Brown, 46, has been with the company for 23 years and has been acting finance chief since May, the group said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
